    {
     "cohort": "other",
     "replicate": 1,
     "text": "We need this clarity now. With 85% of us paid below midpoint, ambiguity is costing us retention. Publishing IC3-IC4 criteria removes guesswork, and a June window accelerates progression for those currently stalled. Let\u2019s stop leaving career growth to chance."
    },
    {
     "cohort": "under 1 year",
     "replicate": 1,
     "text": "This is huge! Clear criteria would help us understand exactly what we need to hit for our next step. And a June window? Yes please! Two promotions a year feels like too long of a wait when we\u2019re eager to grow. Can\u2019t wait to get started!"
